Data Usage & Disclaimer

This software is a research tool only. It is not a financial advisory system,
not an automated trading system, and does not produce buy/sell signals or
investment recommendations.

The intelligence sources integrated into this system (Reuters, WSJ,
Investing.com, Wind, 财联社, etc.) are subject to their own respective terms
of service. Users are responsible for complying with the terms of each data
source they access.

This software must not be used to provide trading advice, investment
recommendations, or any form of financial guidance to third parties.
